WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.238
What's available in G C C?

2
00:00:02.238 --> 00:00:07.884
G C C Moderate uses the commercial Entra
service and pairs with commercial Azure, so

3
00:00:07.884 --> 00:00:13.450
the workspace, the workbook and the Logs
Ingestion API are all in commercial Azure.

4
00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:16.275
Sentinel workbooks are
generally available there.

5
00:00:16.275 --> 00:00:20.155
Entra and Intune both send
their logs to the workspace;

6
00:00:20.155 --> 00:00:25.587
Microsoft says Intune in G C C is the
same instance as the commercial service.

7
00:00:25.587 --> 00:00:30.762
Defender X D R alerts and incidents
are generally available for G C C.

8
00:00:30.762 --> 00:00:33.473
The Defender portal's
connector overview is a

9
00:00:33.473 --> 00:00:36.112
commercial-cloud preview,
so it isn't assumed.

10
00:00:36.112 --> 00:00:40.271
And Entra Health monitoring and
Connect Health are not yet specified,

11
00:00:40.271 --> 00:00:41.900
so their tabs are link-outs.
